---
import Legal from '../layouts/Legal.astro';
import Placeholder from '../components/Placeholder.astro';
import site from '../data/site.json';
const email = site.contact.email;
---
<Legal title="Privacy Policy" description="How Edunotech collects, uses and protects personal information submitted through this website." updated="[Date of approval]">
  <p>This policy explains what personal information Edunotech ("we", "us") collects through this website, why we collect it, and the choices you have. We aim to handle personal information in line with the Nigeria Data Protection Act 2023 and other laws that apply to us.</p>

  <h2>Who we are</h2>
  <p>Edunotech is a technology and education company. For any privacy question or request, contact us at {email ? <a href={`mailto:${email}`}>{email}</a> : <Placeholder label="Official email" />}.</p>

  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <p>We only collect information you choose to give us through our forms:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Contact form:</strong> your name, email address, organisation and phone number (both optional), the type of enquiry, a subject and your message.</li>
    <li><strong>ECIC interest form:</strong> your name, email address, phone number and school or organisation (optional), the ways you would like to take part, and a short description of your interest.</li>
    <li><strong>Newsletter signup:</strong> your email address.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We also record that you agreed to this policy when you submitted a form.</p>

  <h2>Information collected automatically</h2>
  <p>Like most websites, our hosting provider processes technical information such as your IP address and browser type to deliver the site and protect it from abuse. Our forms use a spam check (Cloudflare Turnstile) that may process similar technical information. <Placeholder label="Describe the analytics tool here once one is chosen, and whether it uses cookies" /></p>

  <h2>How we use your information</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To respond to your enquiry or request.</li>
    <li>To discuss services, programmes, partnerships or ECIC participation you have asked about.</li>
    <li>To send you our newsletter, only if you signed up for it.</li>
    <li>To keep the website secure and prevent spam.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We rely on your consent, which you give by ticking the box on each form. You can withdraw it at any time by emailing us. We do not sell your personal information. We do not add you to marketing lists unless you ask us to, and every newsletter tells you how to unsubscribe.</p>

  <h2>Where your information is stored</h2>
  <p>Form submissions are stored in a database run by Cloudflare, our website host. Only authorised Edunotech staff can see them, after signing in through Cloudflare's access control. Cloudflare may store and process this data outside Nigeria.</p>

  <h2>Who we share it with</h2>
  <p>We use service providers to host the website, store form submissions and, where set up, notify our team by email: Cloudflare <Placeholder label="Add the email service (e.g. Resend) and newsletter tool once chosen" />. These providers may process data outside Nigeria. We only use providers that commit to protecting it.</p>

  <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
  <p>We keep enquiry and ECIC information for as long as needed to deal with your enquiry and any resulting relationship, and then delete it. <Placeholder label="Confirm retention period, e.g. 24 months after last contact" /> We keep newsletter signups until you unsubscribe.</p>

  <h2>Children and young people</h2>
  <p>ECIC is for university students, and earlier ECIC activities also involved secondary school students. If you are under 18, please make sure a parent, guardian or teacher knows you are contacting us. Where we work with students through schools, we will follow the school's arrangements for consent.</p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>You can ask us to access, correct or delete the personal information we hold about you, or object to how we use it. Contact us using the details above. You also have the right to complain to the Nigeria Data Protection Commission.</p>

  <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p>We may update this policy from time to time. The date at the top shows when it was last changed.</p>
</Legal>
